 of any busy  streets I asked him if he had to pay a  bribe  no comment he says the mood is now more  upbeat  I don't mind is so free today  everybody's being themselves and waving  their flags then comes the big moment in  my heart is almost in my mouth the  Ugandan gay pride march gets underway  [Music]  they've waited for a long time for this  last year the police put a stop to the  parade before it really got started  this time the gays and lesbians are able  to march for half an hour along Entebbe  Beach undisturbed they're very relieved  and begin to dream of a different you  get  [Music]  to have a free and liberated people LGBT  people who live in harmony with the rest  of the community  I've spent nearly a week with Richard  and the others and been impressed by  their courage I've seen problems but  also signs of hope and who knows maybe  next year they'll be able to take their  march from the beach to the center of  Kampala  [Music]

